  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt.<br>• Cut potato (peel if you prefer) into large chunks. Peel garlic cloves.<br>• Cook potato and garlic in the boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 mins. Drain and return to the pan. <br>• Add the milk and 1/2 the butter to potato and season with salt. Mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68870e54b6ffa7a20c3b9b22/step-ce0a7000.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato. Thinly slice carrot into rounds. Drain and rinse cannellini beans.<br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. <br>• Cook carrot until tender, 4-5 mins. <br>• Add cannellini beans and tomato and cook until softened, 1-2 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68870e54b6ffa7a20c3b9b22/step-50590410.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Stir in passata, Mediterranean seasoning, the stock powder and water into the bean mixture and simmer until slightly reduced, 2-3 mins. <br>• Remove from heat, then add baby spinach and the remaining butter, stirring <br>to combine. <br>• Season to taste with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68870e54b6ffa7a20c3b9b22/step-7894c820.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide garlic mash and white bean stew between bowls.<br>• Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68870e54b6ffa7a20c3b9b22/step-60512d30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
